  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 10415656960
    m_Localized: Upon reaching chamber 100, the man received an unexpected visit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13158731776
    m_Localized: The Genie congratulated him for his commitment and encouraged him
      to persevere until the end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17453699072
    m_Localized: "Then he spoke of the existence of a Legendary Chest\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20037390336
    m_Localized: "\u201C\u2026a treasure that can only be opened with the three fragments
      of the Sacred Key,\u201D declared the Genie."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22855962624
    m_Localized: "\u201CIf you manage to open that Chest, you will cease to be just
      a Piece\u2026 and you will become a true Crowned King,\u201D assured the Genie."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27385810944
    m_Localized: With that promise, the man renewed his strength and accepted the
      challenges that still awaited him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
